sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Contributor
    participant W as Website and servers
    participant AD as Admin
    participant IT as IT reviewer
    participant TE as Technical reviewer
    participant LI as Literature reviewer
    participant PUB as Public archive
    C->>W: Submit article, 2 report PDFs, Google Doc link
    W-->>C: Reference + access key, confirmation email
    Note over W: Status SUBMITTED
    AD->>W: Intake check, approve
    Note over W: Status IT_REVIEW
    IT->>W: Review the Google Doc and reports, approve
    Note over W: Status TECH_REVIEW
    TE->>W: Check technical accuracy, approve
    Note over W: Status LIT_REVIEW
    LI->>W: Check language and citations, suggest tags, approve
    Note over W: Status FINAL_APPROVAL
    AD->>W: Upload final PDF, finalise title, author credit, abstract, tags
    AD->>W: Publish, after confirming the preview
    W->>PUB: Copy PDF to public storage, add to archive and search
    W-->>C: Published email
    Note over C,PUB: Status PUBLISHED - visitors can read, download and cite it
